Status as of 27 October 2026.

## Starting a case from a template in a department workspace

At the moment, a case from a template that was created in a department workspace can be started only by a manager of that department who is marked as a partner (**Admin** › **Users** › **Mark as partner**). Other admins and managers either see **+ New Case** greyed out, or get a permission error when they select **Create Case**.

This is a known issue. Until it is fixed, ask a partner in the department, for example Demo Manager, to start these cases.
